{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116933","id":3341677735,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HLfSn","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116933","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116933.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116933.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116933","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116933/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116933/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116933/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4fee22ff791ee804dc6132862820e05ad97449c4","number":116933,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix iOS simulator linking for x86_64 and EditorLog URL crash","user":{"login":"gumaciel","id":20030153,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDMwMTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20030153?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel","html_url":"https://github.com/gumaciel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When exporting an iOS project, the generated `.xcarchive` stayed in the export directory, which poisoned Xcode's linker search paths for simulator builds with arm64 device dylibs. This commit moves the .xcarchive straight to the standard macOS Archives directory `(~/Library/Developer/Xcode/Archives/YYYY-MM-DD/)` so it fixes the simulator linking issue and allows the build to instantly appear inside Xcode Organizer.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, this adds explicit URI schema checks (`file://`, `http://`) to `EditorLog::_meta_clicked`, preventing a 64-bit integer overflow crash caused by attempting to parse system file paths with colons as script line numbers.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis bug reproduces in:\r\n- Godot 4.6.1 stable and 4.7 dev/master branches.\r\n- Mac Intel x86_64\r\n- Xcode Version 26.2 (17C52)\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n- Export to iOS normally\r\n- On Xcode, build to simulator\r\n\r\nBug: <img width=\"1348\" height=\"783\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-03-01 at 15 39 03\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33d89de6-3eeb-4f63-abe7-48384fe6294c\" />\r\n\r\nChanges in export: <img width=\"1155\" height=\"234\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-03-01 at 17 24 48\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/440d0c34-4510-4eae-b6c6-e685b043e695\" />","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github